{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:957d44eb43f16979","name":"Seyugi Dervish Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-957d44eb43f16979","title":"Seyugi Dervish Talent Tree","revision":20514,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:00:12Z","sha256":"2974e2d245e8d16896fee34a6894fd5c62967273c20748579ffeac66c702d50a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20514","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Seyugi%20Dervish%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-957d44eb43f16979","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Seyugi Dervishes are masters of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," combat augmented by their control over ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", and they traditionally hire themselves out as contract assassins. Their Force abilities allow them to move unseen and to make devastating, lightning-quick assaults on their targets. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Seyugi Dervishes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Seyugi_Dervishes","referenceId":"reference:e85865866322b788"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Seyugi Cyclone"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you are wielding no weapons (other than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:bad45a025bb351a0"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shockboxing Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shockboxing_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:8c3db44f5f831f1d"},"), you can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," feat as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," by spending a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},", even if you do not possess the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," feat. Additionally, this Talent satisfies the prerequisites for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mobile Whirlwind"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seyugi Cyclone"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," feat, you can move up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," after the attack is resolved.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Repelling Whirlwind"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seyugi Cyclone"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against any target hit by your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sudden Storm"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seyugi Cyclone"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Instead of a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"}," at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", provided you are not wielding any weapons (other than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:bad45a025bb351a0"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shockboxing Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shockboxing_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:8c3db44f5f831f1d"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tempest Tossed"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seyugi Cyclone"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you damage a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Whirlwind Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack","referenceId":"reference:42e4a091048fa93e"},", you can choose to move that target 1 square in any direction as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". You can't move a target that's being ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},", and you can't move the opponent into a solid object or another creature's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},". This forced movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
